\label{l:arithmeticcoefficients9}
The series
\[
 \sum_{\substack{q\geq1\\P^+(q)\leq R}}
 \mathfrak G_q(\ell,k,n)
\]
converges absolutely and satisfies
\begin{align}\label{e:localGR92}
 \sum_{\substack{q\geq1\\P^+(q)\leq R}}
