where \(G_R\) is defined in \eqref{e:defGR9}.
Moreover, for some absolute \(C_1>0\),
\begin{align}\label{e:arithmeticcoefficients9}
 |\mathfrak s(a,q)|
 &\ll q^{-1/2}\tau(q)^{C_1},\notag\\
 |\Upsilon(a\ell,q,a_{k,\ell},k)|
